.Dd September 3, 2026
.Dt VDOTS-LISTEN 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm vdots-listen
.Nd publish read-aloud sessions to a listenable library
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Ic publish
.Ar FILE.md
.Op Fl -voice Ar V
.Op Fl -tone Ar T
.Op Fl -pace Ar P
.Op Fl -rate Ar N
.Op Fl -force
.Op Fl -open
.Op Fl v
.Nm
.Ic info Ar FILE.md
.Nm
.Brq Ic rebuild | open | ls | path
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
builds and maintains the listen library under
.Ev $VDOTS_LISTEN_DIR
.Pq default Pa ~/ai/outbox/listen ,
which Google Drive desktop syncs everywhere. Prefer
.Xr vdots-publish 1 ,
which adds a pre-flight report.
.Sh COMMANDS
.Bl -tag -width "rebuild"
.It Ic publish Ar FILE.md Op Ar opts
Render one session and regenerate the catalog. A
.Pa <base>.spoken.md
sibling is used in place of
.Pa <base>.md
unless
.Ev VDOTS_RAW Ns = Ns 1 .
Re-publishing the same, not-newer source is an idempotent no-op;
.Fl -force
overrides.
.It Ic info Ar FILE.md
Pre-flight parse report \(em mode, title, chapters, estimate, frontmatter
drift \(em no audio, no write.
.It Ic rebuild
Regenerate
.Pa index.html , index.md ,
and every
.Pa article.html
from the on-disk
.Pa meta.json Ns s .
.It Ic open
Open
.Pa $VDOTS_LISTEN_DIR/index.html .
.It Ic ls
List published session directories.
.It Ic path
Print
.Ev $VDOTS_LISTEN_DIR .
.El
.Sh SESSION LAYOUT
.Bd -literal -offset indent
<YYYY-MM-DD-title-slug>/
  audio.mp3        read-through; transcript embedded as an id3 lyrics frame
  audio.m4a        same audio, +faststart +chapters (Apple Music / VLC)
  readalong.mp4    the transcript scrolling with the narration, burned in;
                   plays in Google Drive's video player (web / iOS / Android)
  brief.md         self-contained analysis brief \(em open in Gemini from Drive
  manifest.md      interview-prep packs only: a research kit \(em file map +
                   web links so an AI chat can research the job independently
  document.md      clean readable copy of the source
  report.md        readability + chapters + full transcript (Drive-previewable)
  transcript.txt   verbatim prose
  captions.vtt     WebVTT captions
  article.html     browser page: player + synced, auto-scrolling transcript
  meta.json        title, date, duration, voice, pace, chapters, metrics
  assets/          cues.json, readability.json, chapters.{vtt,json}, spoken.txt
.Ed
.Pp
The catalog
.Pa index.md
is the phone surface: Google Drive renders it and the links play
.Pa audio.mp3 .
The
.Pa article.html
player and its synced highlight only run in a real browser \(em Drive's HTML
preview sandboxes JavaScript and media. For synced read-along from Drive, use
.Pa readalong.mp4
(the transcript is burned into the video, so no JavaScript is involved) \(em
built by
.Xr vdots-readalong 1 .
.Sh AUDIO
.Xr say 1
renders at the preset's true rate, then the whole file is time-stretched
.Pf ( Xr rubberband 1 No R3 engine, else Xr ffmpeg 1 Ic atempo )
for a measured pace.
.Xr ffmpeg 1
embeds chapters (from the frontmatter
.Ic sections )
and the transcript-as-lyrics, and adds
.Ic +faststart
to the m4a. The mp3 is transcoded with clean ID3 tags only.
.Sh ENVIRONMENT
.Bl -tag -width VDOTS_LISTEN_DIR
.It Ev VDOTS_LISTEN_DIR
Library root. Default
.Pa ~/ai/outbox/listen .
.It Ev VDOTS_RAW
.Ql 1
publishes the named file, not a
.Pa .spoken.md
sibling.
.It Ev VDOTS_RESUME_URL , Ev VDOTS_PORTFOLIO_URL
Candidate links written into
.Pa manifest.md
for interview-prep packs. Default to the just3ws.github.io résumé JSON and
www.just3ws.com.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr ffmpeg 1 ,
.Xr rubberband 1 ,
.Xr vdots 1 ,
.Xr vdots-publish 1 ,
.Xr vdots-read 1 ,
.Xr vdots-readability 1 ,
.Xr vdots-readalong 1
